# .dockerignore
#
# Same idea as .gitignore, but for what gets sent into the Docker build
# context. Keeps the image smaller and avoids accidentally baking in
# things like your .env file (which contains your real API key).

.env
.git
.gitignore
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
README.md
support-triage-roadmap.md
scratch_test.py
.github/
